<view class="container">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">ESP32-CAM 接入</view>
    <view class="card-sub">填写摄像头模块在局域网中的 IP 即可查看实时画面</view>

    <view class="row">
      <view class="label">CAM IP</view>
      <input class="input" placeholder="例如 192.168.1.123" value="{{ip}}" bindinput="onIpInput" />
    </view>

    <view class="actions">
      <button class="btn-primary" wx:if="{{!streaming}}" bindtap="startStream">连 接</button>
      <button class="btn-stop" wx:else bindtap="stopStream">断 开</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card stream-card" wx:if="{{streaming}}">
    <view class="row-between">
      <view class="card-title" style="margin: 0">实时画面</view>
      <view class="tag tag-success" wx:if="{{!error}}">在线 · {{fps}} fps</view>
      <view class="tag tag-danger" wx:else>异常</view>
    </view>
    <view class="frame-wrap">
      <image
        wx:if="{{src}}"
        class="frame"
        mode="aspectFit"
        src="{{src}}"
        bindload="onFrameLoad"
        binderror="onFrameError"
      />
      <view wx:else class="frame-placeholder">连接中…</view>
    </view>
    <view class="error-text" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card hint-card" wx:if="{{!streaming}}">
    <view class="muted">
      使用步骤：
      {{'\n'}}1. 用 USB-TTL 把 Arduino IDE 自带的 CameraWebServer 示例烧入 ESP32-CAM
      {{'\n'}}2. 打开串口监视器，记下 Camera Ready 后打印的 IP
      {{'\n'}}3. 把这个 IP（不要带 http://）填入上方输入框
      {{'\n'}}4. 点连接后约 1-2 秒出现实时画面
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
